# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ECC project-scoped install (~703 generated files).
# Committing it wholesale would bury the project in a reader's first impression.
# We track only the three things we author ourselves.
#
# Order matters: exclude the CONTENTS (.claude/*), not the directory (.claude/).
# Git cannot re-include a path inside an excluded directory, so `.claude/`
# would make every negation below silently dead.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/
.claude/hooks/*
!.claude/hooks/py-gate.js
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/golden-set-review/
!.claude/skills/eval-protocol/

# Personal, machine-specific, or runtime state — never shared.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.observer-tmp/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
*.egg
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets. ANTHROPIC_API_KEY lives here and must never be committed.
# .env.example IS tracked and documents every required variable.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data: what is tracked here is deliberate, and is the point of the project.
#
#   TRACKED   data/corpus/     snapshotted corpus + manifest (~3 MB zstd)
#   TRACKED   data/golden/     the golden set, candidates, review log
#   TRACKED   data/cache/      committed embedding/rerank/judgment caches (~15 MB)
#   TRACKED   data/tokenizers/ vendored tokenizer, so chunking needs no network
#
# Those four make "clone and reproduce with one command" true. Only the raw
# unprocessed fetch is ignored, because it is regenerable and large.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/raw/
data/scratch/

# Local model weights (~1.25 GB). Fetched into a Docker volume, never committed.
models/
.hf-cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Results ARE tracked — they are the audit trail the project exists to produce.
# Only transient local runs are ignored.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
results/scratch/
results/*.tmp.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor / OS noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
